# ==============================================================================
# ShasthoSetu AI — Git Ignore Policy
# Heavy clinical datasets (~9 GB) & checkpoints are hosted on Hugging Face:
#   https://huggingface.co/datasets/ashik1236/shasthosetu-clinical-datasets
# Lightweight reproducible ML research code lives in research/01..06 (tracked).
# Curated 5-system QA sample pack lives inside testingmainapps/ (tracked).
# ==============================================================================

